# Node.js Security

Review:
- File system operations
- Path traversal
- child_process
- eval
- Dynamic imports
- Unsafe deserialization
- Request parsing
- Input validation
- File uploads
- Error handling

Never allow untrusted input to become
an executable command or code.

Uploaded files must never be treated as
trusted application code.
